{"4254090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project - Labyrinth", "steam_appid": 4254090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4893180], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254090/extras/610fe6a49aa3e80352204e00d805ac61.avif?t=1786917248\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake with no memory. Bound to the Blade of Spades, you find yourself deep within a labyrinth that stretches endlessly downward. What could have brought you here? You play as the Dealer, The Death Dealer. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254090/extras/26ffaec23c11bf9e31eed662905f90f1.avif?t=1786917248\" width=779 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>⚔️ Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sette e Mezzo — Blackjack — 21. Pushing your luck is part of the strategy. Get close to 21, press your advantage. Bust, and suffer the consequences. Time your parries or take the full hit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254090/extras/3d3f13d9f5c15c19c026951533210c2d.poster.avif?t=1786917248\" width=778 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254090/extras/3d3f13d9f5c15c19c026951533210c2d.webm?t=1786917248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4254090/extras/3d3f13d9f5c15c19c026951533210c2d.mp4?t=1786917248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>🔨️ Craft Items</strong></p><p class=\"bb_parag